              <p class="panel-hint">Pick a tag per column. Bind <strong>fill</strong> to <code>gauge_colN</code>. Check <strong>Tag scale</strong> to use tag <strong>OL/OH</strong> for column height. The left <strong>Y-axis scale</strong> uses the min/max above.</p>
            </div>
            <div id="hmi-push-button-panel" class="hmi-strip-chart-panel hmi-symbol-setup-panel view-hidden">
              <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Push button</h4>
              <div class="form-grid compact">
                <label>Interaction
                  <select id="hmi-push-button-mode" class="input-sm" title="Momentary: active while pressed. Latched: click toggles BOOL tag.">
                    <option value="momentary">Momentary</option>
                    <option value="latched">Latched</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <label>Shape
                  <select id="hmi-push-button-shape" class="input-sm" title="Button outline shape">
                    <option value="square">Square</option>
                    <option value="rectangle">Rectangle</option>
                    <option value="oblong">Oblong</option>
                    <option value="round">Round</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div id="hmi-push-button-palette" class="hmi-strip-pen-palette"></div>
              <p class="panel-hint">Set <strong>Background</strong>, <strong>Text</strong>, and <strong>Bezel</strong> (shadow) colors. Bind BOOL <strong>fill</strong> to the <code>button</code> element for on/off state.</p>
            </div>
            <div id="hmi-pilot-light-panel" class="hmi-strip-chart-panel hmi-symbol-setup-panel view-hidden">
              <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Pilot light</h4>
              <div class="form-grid compact">
                <label>Type
                  <select id="hmi-pilot-light-kind" class="input-sm" title="Simple BOOL on/off or complex 5-state INT">
                    <option value="simple">Simple (BOOL off/on)</option>
                    <option value="complex">Complex (5-state)</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
                <label>Shape
                  <select id="hmi-pilot-light-shape" class="input-sm" title="Pilot light outline shape">
                    <option value="round">Round</option>
                    <option value="square">Square</option>
                    <option value="octagonal">Octagonal</option>
                  </select>
                </label>
              </div>
              <div id="hmi-pilot-light-palette" class="hmi-strip-pen-palette"></div>
              <p class="panel-hint">Simple: bind BOOL <strong>fill</strong> to <code>lamp</code>. Complex: bind INT <strong>fill5</strong> (0=Off … 4=Offline); states 2–3 flash.</p>
            </div>
                </section>

                <section class="hmi-composer-section" data-hmi-section="recent" id="hmi-section-recent">
                  <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Recently used</h4>
                  <p class="panel-hint">Symbols you placed recently — click or drag onto the grid. Use <strong>Symbols</strong> for the full library and filters.</p>
                  <div id="hmi-recent-asset-grid" class="hmi-asset-grid" role="listbox" aria-label="Recently used HMI symbols" tabindex="0"></div>
                  <p id="hmi-recent-asset-hint" class="muted cell-mono"></p>
                </section>

                <section class="hmi-composer-section active" data-hmi-section="layout" id="hmi-section-layout">
            <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Project layout</h4>
            <div class="form-grid compact">
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Layout preset
                <select id="hmi-layout-preset" title="Common grid + cell + display sizes">
                  <option value="default">Default 8×8 · 1024×800</option>
                  <option value="wide">Wide 12×8 · 1536×800</option>
                  <option value="fhd">Full HD 1920×1080</option>
                  <option value="custom">Custom</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Columns
                <select id="hmi-grid-cols" title="Number of grid columns"></select>
              </label>
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Rows
                <select id="hmi-grid-rows" title="Number of grid rows"></select>
              </label>
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Cell width (px)
                <select id="hmi-cell-width" title="Logical width per column"></select>
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-cell-width-custom-wrap" class="view-hidden hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Custom cell width
                <input id="hmi-cell-width-custom" type="number" min="8" max="512" value="128" class="input-sm" title="Custom cell width (8–512 px)">
              </label>
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Cell height (px)
                <select id="hmi-cell-height" title="Logical height per row"></select>
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-cell-height-custom-wrap" class="view-hidden hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Custom cell height
                <input id="hmi-cell-height-custom" type="number" min="8" max="512" value="100" class="input-sm" title="Custom cell height (8–512 px)">
              </label>
              <label class="hmi-composer-mode-grid-only">Grid lines
                <select id="hmi-show-grid" title="Show or hide grid lines in the composer preview">
                  <option value="show" selected>Show grid lines</option>
                  <option value="hide">Hide grid lines</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label>Live status
                <select id="hmi-show-live-status" title="Screen title and hint below screen tabs on the live HMI">
                  <option value="show" selected>Show status message</option>
                  <option value="hide">Hide status message</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label>Composer mode
                <select id="hmi-composer-mode" title="Grid tile editor or 3D facility spatial preview">
                  <option value="grid">Grid — 2D tile editing</option>
                  <option value="3d">3D — facility spatial view</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>
            <p class="panel-hint">Default 8×8 at 128×100 px per cell → 1024×800 display. Grid layout applies to <strong>all screens</strong>. Composer mode is also in <strong>Project ▾</strong> menu.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="hmi-composer-section" data-hmi-section="display" id="hmi-section-display">
            <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Display size</h4>
            <div class="form-grid compact">
              <label>Background
                <select id="hmi-screen-bg" class="hmi-color-select"></select>
              </label>
              <label>Logical size
                <select id="hmi-logical-preset" title="Design resolution — match grid or pick a preset">
                  <option value="match-grid" selected>Match grid (cols × cell)</option>
                  <option value="800x600">800 × 600</option>
                  <option value="1024x800">1024 × 800</option>
                  <option value="1280x720">1280 × 720</option>
                  <option value="1366x768">1366 × 768</option>
                  <option value="1920x1080">1920 × 1080</option>
                  <option value="1920x1200">1920 × 1200</option>
                  <option value="custom">Custom…</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-logical-custom-wrap" class="view-hidden">Logical X (px)
                <input id="hmi-screen-width" type="number" min="200" max="4096" value="1024" class="input-sm" title="Design width (columns × cell width)">
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-logical-custom-wrap-y" class="view-hidden">Logical Y (px)
                <input id="hmi-screen-height" type="number" min="150" max="4096" value="800" class="input-sm" title="Design height (rows × cell height)">
              </label>
              <label>Display limit
                <select id="hmi-display-preset" title="Max size on live HMI and composer preview">
                  <option value="match-logical" selected>Match logical size</option>
                  <option value="800x600">800 × 600</option>
                  <option value="1024x800">1024 × 800</option>
                  <option value="1280x720">1280 × 720</option>
                  <option value="1366x768">1366 × 768</option>
                  <option value="1920x1080">1920 × 1080</option>
                  <option value="1920x1200">1920 × 1200</option>
                  <option value="custom">Custom…</option>
                </select>
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-display-custom-wrap" class="view-hidden">Display limit X (px)
                <input id="hmi-display-max-width" type="number" min="100" max="4096" value="1024" class="input-sm" title="Max width on live HMI and preview">
              </label>
              <label id="hmi-display-custom-wrap-y" class="view-hidden">Display limit Y (px)
                <input id="hmi-display-max-height" type="number" min="100" max="4096" value="800" class="input-sm" title="Max height on live HMI and preview">
              </label>
              <label>Fit in viewport
                <select id="hmi-screen-fit" title="How the grid fills the display limit box">
                  <option value="contain">Contain (keep aspect)</option>
                  <option value="stretch">Stretch (fill limit X and Y)</option>
                  <option value="cover">Cover (crop to fill)</option>
                  <option value="native">Native (1:1 px)</option>
                </select>
              </label>
            </div>
            <p class="panel-hint">Use <strong>Stretch</strong> to fill the display limit horizontally and vertically. <strong>Contain</strong> letterboxes inside the limit. Set limit X/Y to your panel or monitor size (e.g. 1920×1080).</p>
            <input type="hidden" id="hmi-screen-scale" value="100">
            <input type="hidden" id="hmi-screen-offset-x" value="0">
            <input type="hidden" id="hmi-screen-offset-y" value="0">
                </section>

                <section class="hmi-composer-section" data-hmi-section="bindings" id="hmi-section-bindings">
            <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Bindings <span id="hmi-binding-count" class="muted"></span>
              <label class="tag-display-pick hmi-tag-display-pick" title="Tag column shows id, label, or both">Show
                <select id="hmi-tag-display" data-tag-display-mode></select>
              </label>
            </h4>
            <datalist id="hmi-element-ids"></datalist>
            <div class="toolbar wrap">
              <button type="button" id="btn-hmi-add-binding" class="btn">Add binding</button>
              <button type="button" id="btn-hmi-test-screen" class="btn primary">Test screen</button>
              <button type="button" id="btn-hmi-clear-binding-test" class="btn">Clear test values</button>
            </div>
            <p class="panel-hint"><strong>Composites</strong> (recommended): use the <strong>Composites</strong> filter — one click places dial + needle and adds bindings. Test: enter a value in the row <strong>Test</strong> column, then <strong>Test screen</strong>.</p>
            <div id="hmi-bindings-table" class="table-wrap"></div>
                </section>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hmi-composer-col-splitter" id="hmi-composer-col-splitter" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-label="Resize composer settings column" title="Drag to widen settings column"></div>
          <div class="hmi-setup-preview-wrap">
            <div class="hmi-composer-header">
              <h4 class="hmi-block-title">Screen grid</h4>
              <div class="hmi-grid-toolbar">
                <button type="button" id="btn-hmi-delete-tile" class="btn danger" title="Remove selected cell">Remove cell</button>
                <button type="button" id="btn-hmi-clear-grid" class="btn danger" title="Clear all symbols on this screen">Clear grid</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="panel-hint">Grid with row/column labels — for editing only. The live HMI hides grid lines.</p>
            <div id="hmi-setup-preview" class="hmi-viewport hmi-setup-preview hmi-tile-composer"></div>
            <p id="hmi-preview-meta" class="muted cell-mono"></p>
            <div id="hmi-setup-3d-preview" class="hmi-viewport hmi-setup-3d-preview view-hidden" aria-label="3D facility composer preview">
              <iframe id="hmi-setup-3d-frame" title="3D facility composer" src="/samples/assisted-living-ortho-3d.html"></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="popup-resize-handle popup-resize-w" data-resize="w" aria-hidden="true"
        onmousedown="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"
        ontouchstart="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"></div>
      <div class="popup-resize-handle popup-resize-s" data-resize="s" aria-hidden="true"
        onmousedown="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"
        ontouchstart="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"></div>
      <div class="popup-resize-handle popup-resize-e" data-resize="e" aria-hidden="true"
        onmousedown="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"
        ontouchstart="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"></div>
      <div class="popup-resize-handle popup-resize-sw" data-resize="sw" aria-hidden="true"
        onmousedown="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"
        ontouchstart="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"></div>
      <div class="popup-resize-handle popup-resize-se" data-resize="se" aria-hidden="true"
        onmousedown="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"
        ontouchstart="window.PeakLogicHmi&amp;&amp;window.PeakLogicHmi.onPanelResizeStart(event,this)"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="app-popup view-hidden" data-popup="help" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="popup-help-title">
    <div class="popup-chrome popup-chrome-help">
      <header class="popup-header popup-header-split">
        <h2 id="popup-help-title">PeakLogic Help</h2>
        <div class="popup-header-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn popup-close" data-popup-close="help" title="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="help-panel" id="help-panel">
        <nav class="help-nav" data-help-nav aria-label="Help topics"></nav>
        <div class="help-body popup-scroll" data-help-body></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <dialog id="st-pid-dialog" class="program-picker-dialog st-pid-dialog">
    <form method="dialog" class="program-picker-form">
      <header class="popup-header popup-header-split">
        <h2>PID loop (ST)</h2>
        <div class="popup-header-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn popup-close" id="st-pid-cancel" title="Cancel">Cancel</button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="program-picker-form-body">
        <p class="panel-hint">Pick PV and CV from VPI, VPR, or other INT/REAL tags. Inserts <span class="cell-mono">PidPv</span> / <span class="cell-mono">PidOut</span> ST.</p>
        <label class="fb-field-lbl">PID block
          <select id="st-pid-block" class="st-pid-tag-select"></select>
        </label>
        <label class="fb-field-lbl">PV (process variable)
          <select id="st-pid-pv" class="st-pid-tag-select"></select>
        </label>
        <label class="fb-field-lbl">CV (control output)
          <select id="st-pid-cv" class="st-pid-tag-select"></select>
        </label>
        <label class="fb-field-lbl">SP tag <span class="muted">(optional)</span>
          <select id="st-pid-sp" class="st-pid-tag-select"></select>
        </label>
        <label class="st-pid-auto-lbl"><input type="checkbox" id="st-pid-auto" checked> Auto mode (<span class="cell-mono">PidAuto</span>)</label>
      </div>
      <footer class="popup-footer">
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary" value="apply">Insert ST</button>
      </footer>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <dialog id="project-picker-dialog" class="program-picker-dialog">
    <form method="dialog" class="program-picker-form">
      <header class="popup-header popup-header-split">
        <h2>Open project from data/projects/</h2>
        <div class="popup-header-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn popup-close" id="project-picker-cancel" title="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="program-picker-form-body">
        <p class="panel-hint cell-mono" id="project-picker-dir"></p>
        <select id="project-picker-list" class="program-picker-list" size="14" required></select>
      </div>
      <footer class="popup-footer">
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary" value="open">Open</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="project-picker-import">Import file…</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="project-picker-export">Export file…</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn" id="project-picker-folder">Open folder…</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn danger" id="project-picker-delete">Delete…</button>
      </footer>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <dialog id="program-picker-dialog" class="program-picker-dialog">
    <form method="dialog" class="program-picker-form">
      <header class="popup-header popup-header-split">
        <h2>Open program from st/</h2>
        <div class="popup-header-actions">
          <button type="button" class="btn popup-close" id="program-picker-cancel" title="Close">Close</button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="program-picker-form-body">
        <p class="panel-hint cell-mono" id="program-picker-dir"></p>
        <select id="program-picker-list" class="program-picker-list" size="14" required></select>
      </div>
      <footer class="popup-footer">
        <button type="submit" class="btn primary" value="open">Open</button>
      </footer>
    </form>
  </dialog>

  <script src="/js/api.js"></script>
  <script>
    window.PEAKLOGIC_BUILD = {
      version: '<%= appVersion %>',
      company: '<%= companyName %>',
      product: '<%= product %>',
      deployment: '<%= deployment %>',
      estVersion: <%= estVersion %>,
      hmiComposerVersion: '1.2',
    };
  </script>
  <script src="/js/peaklogicCore.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/graph.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/hmiAssetPaths.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/tagDisplay.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/hmi.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/hmiViewMode.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/hmiSetupUi.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/tagDisplay.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/stEditor.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/stPidEditor.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/windowStack.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/floatingPanel.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/expansionIo.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/programIoTags.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/liveIoUpdate.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/ioTimestamp.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/programUi.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/help.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/roiCalculator.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/hardwareWizardUi.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
  <script src="/js/app.js?v=<%= assetV %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
